WEBVTT

hook
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Fibonacci is one member of a
whole family of two-step rules.

family
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.600
Other coefficients and seeds give
Lucas, Pell, even an oscillator.

data
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.900
The recorded values show it:
three sequences grow, one cycles.

state-space
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.300
Stack two neighbors into a state,
and one matrix, C, moves it forward.

roots
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:25.500
The eigenvalues of C are its roots, and
the larger one usually sets the growth.

edge-case
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.700
When the two roots collide, the
solution gains a factor linear in n.

recap
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:38.100
Coefficients pick the rule, seeds
the start, and roots the long run.
